# Cursor Rules for Technical Challenge - Full Stack Developer with AI

## Project Context
This is a technical challenge for a Senior Full Stack Developer position with AI integration. The project evaluates:
- Python development skills (FastAPI/Flask)
- REST API development
- AI tool integration (AWS Textract, Azure Cognitive Services, OpenAI)
- AWS S3 integration
- SQL Server database with SQLAlchemy ORM
- JWT authentication and role-based access control
- Clean architecture and modular design
- Unit testing with Pytest/Unittest
- Version control with GitHub

## Architecture Principles

### Clean Architecture
- Separate concerns into layers: handlers/controllers, services/use cases, repositories/data access, domain models
- Use dependency injection with interfaces, not concrete types
- Keep business logic independent of frameworks
- Follow domain-driven design principles where applicable

